        "name": "USN-8106-1",
        "description": "It was discovered that Valkey incorrectly handled errors for lua scripts. An attacker could possibly use this issue to inject arbitrary information into the response stream for other clients. (CVE-2025-67733)  It was discovered that Valkey incorrectly handled malformed cluster bus messages. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to cause Valkey to crash, resulting in a denial of service. (CVE-2026-21863)",
        "aliases": [
          "CVE-2025-67733",
          "CVE-2026-21863"
        ]
